# DLA-4792-1: tzdata timezone database update (2026b → 2026c).
# Severity: UNKNOWN (Debian LTS advisory, not a CVE).
# This is a timezone data update, not a security vulnerability.
# Suppressed here because distroless images have no package manager — tzdata
# cannot be upgraded in the final stage without rebuilding the base image.
# Permanent fix: update gcr.io/distroless/static-debian12:nonroot SHA digest
# to a version that ships tzdata >= 2026c-0+deb12u1 (run `make pin-base-images`).
DLA-4792-1
